      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    purchase_price = 40\n    sale_price = 55\n    shares = 200\n    discount = 0.15\n    holding_period = 1.5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    discounted_purchase_price = purchase_price * (1 - discount)\n    total_gain = (sale_price - discounted_purchase_price) * shares\n\n    if holding_period >= 2:\n        taxable_income = discount * purchase_price * shares\n    else:\n        taxable_income = total_gain\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(taxable_income)\n```",
